VISUAL MATERIALS

Artwork sources are retained under resources/Textures/Sources/,
resources/Textures/TavernVisuals/sources/, and resources/Icons/Sources/.
Known source information:
- The plank atlas, bookmark, and hanging talismans were generated for Tavern
  with OpenAI tools using project screenshots and concepts as references.
  Runtime images are conversions or manually masked derivatives.
- Button-family artwork was generated using a Tavern agent-settings
  screenshot as a reference; redistribution and reference rights are unverified.
- Sidebar artwork was generated from project concepts and screenshots.
  The retained lantern crop inherits the origin of the earlier Tavern artwork;
  independent rights verification has not been performed.
- Image sources and terms for the agent-card chains are recorded in
  licenses/AgentChains.txt.

resources/Textures/TavernVisuals/sprites/glow.png, particle-core.png, and
particle-soft.png are deterministic procedural radial-falloff shapes authored
by the assistant with Pillow; no image-generation model or source image
was used for these three sprites.
Rights to the generated sources and their references have not been
independently verified. Design approval and inclusion in the app are not
confirmation of rights. Terms for generated materials depend on the
applicable generation agreement and rights to reference materials. Not all
provenance chains have been established; this NOTICE does not assign an author
or a free license to unknown sources.

